j1mUfilmpfGRHlq06wOQHsghWD8vPruqXk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQC582LdL1zBc61gTSVfeBfp78nN7N8yfxTgxrOhOFImYw&oe=6A60ADE4"}, {"file_name": "SampleScene_4K_17.05.2025_15-06-15.png", "id": "1733164250603383", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499361329_1733164253936716_5116391949939568888_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=iWcICR0Q3AQQ7kNvwHnfmTL&_nc_oc=AdqmM8AJUYlfCc8VqljNIpUKiYnu8_zChKaBJhXng8oInDk2sjOfM-vDGa3aiW9ciFo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQBlt6v2Ncd6TjWAbQySHlrhjwp67OWlMOljzXcBVmlWjQ&oe=6A60CE9B"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Untitled571_20250630144933.png", "id": "719729697423252", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491820594_719729700756585_5813998063970535049_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=xc0WQiUgK6wQ7kNvwH4EStn&_nc_oc=AdrD6TjWv62jUMdMtecOl2e3dwVX5F1BEYd_0YuIQHKk12eAd6gUEOrE4denmdhbBsM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQAqxDMoGkD374ubIidk38qSNlrYVSN65P_H4TDWPW93rA&oe=6A60A5D1"}, "display_name": "Bouncing Baboon", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Bouncing Baboon is a explorable game where you can bounce and swing your way through the game, there are a variety of maps you can play through, such as:\n\nForest - Jump around on trampolines or climb up trees for a ton of fun\n\nCaves - Go down the slippery slide into the echoing cave where you will be tasked with mining resources (in a future update)\n\nShop - take a break from the chaos and put on some wear for your baboon\n\nBeach - Jump from platforms sitting on the water to jumping in the water and chill with friends\n\nShore - Ride in the giant ocean in this map with the brand new boats\n\nPool - Swim with friends in this smaller map or get a tan from the upstairs portion\n\nwhether you're a parkour master or a laid-back player, Bouncing Baboon is the game for everyone", "short_